    {
      "type": "Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/providers/contentPackages",
      "apiVersion": "2023-04-01-preview",
      "location": "[parameters('workspace-location')]",
      "properties": {
        "version": "3.0.0",
        "kind": "Solution",
        "contentSchemaVersion": "3.0.0",
        "displayName": "Truvizy Threat Intelligence",
        "publisherDisplayName": "Truvizy",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>Note:</strong> Please refer to the following before installing the solution:</p>\n<p>• Review the solution <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/tree/master/Solutions/Truvizy%20Threat%20Intelligence/ReleaseNotes.md\">Release Notes</a></p>\n<p>• There may be <a href=\"https://aka.ms/sentinelsolutionsknownissues\">known issues</a> pertaining to this Solution, please refer to them before installing.</p>\n<p>The Truvizy Threat Intelligence solution brings scam and phishing indicators confirmed by the <a href=\"https://truvizy.app\">Truvizy</a> detection network into Microsoft Sentinel through the built-in TAXII 2.1 data connector. Indicators are curated for safe blocking: only high-confidence indicators are published, shared platforms (such as youtube.com) are never listed at the domain level, and indicators expire automatically when they stop being relevant. The solution includes analytics rules that match Truvizy indicators against proxy and DNS telemetry, plus a hunting query for feed overview. Feed credentials are issued by the Truvizy team during onboarding.</p>\n<p><strong>Data Connectors:</strong> 1, <strong>Analytic Rules:</strong> 2, <strong>Hunting Queries:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/azuresentinel\">Learn more about Microsoft Sentinel</a> | <a href=\"https://aka.ms/azuresentinelsolutionsdoc\">Learn more about Solutions</a></p>\n",
        "contentKind": "Solution",
        "contentProductId": "[variables('_solutioncontentProductId')]",
        "id": "[variables('_solutioncontentProductId')]",
        "icon": "<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/master/Logos/truvizy-logo.svg\" width=\"75px\" height=\"75px\">",
        "contentId": "[variables('_solutionId')]",
        "parentId": "[variables('_solutionId')]",
